      "decision": "Pure query APIs preserve V1-compatible non-throwing semantics: node lookup returns None, adjacency enumeration returns an empty tuple, and adjacency predicate returns False. Definition validation raises for malformed canonical content. Command paths convert unknown source or destination into explicit unknown_node rejection before any state mutation.",
